    },
    {
      "@id": "docs/source/concepts-harness/instantiation.md#provenance-2",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "history",
      "cat-harness:section": "(top of block)",
      "prov:value": "Owner, 2026-11-08: an instance is an instance of a node kind; Harness is one kind; a repository in the stack is a layer; index.config.json declares which harnesses are instantiated on the repository. Before this the page said a layer became an instantiated Harness by carrying a root config file (cat-harness#1138).",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "2026-11-08",
        "cat-harness#1138"
      ],
